    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būbi bo kūlamya shiikolile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū ūkūshisha ū mu sī īyo ūjile kwīdima ībize yako, hūna ūgapeeja mahanga mingī gūkwīngīla, ga Bahītī, Bagiligashi, Baamoli, Bakanani, Bapelizi, Bahīvī, na Bayebusi, mahanga mpungatī mataale na ga nguzu kūtinda bebe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū ūgatūūla mu nkono gwako a mahanga genayo, nang'ho ūgapyena, īkūkwigelela kūbamala pye gete a banhū benabo. Yaya ū kūbeeja ilagane nabo nūūlū hado, hama yaya gete nūūlū kūbachīla shigongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwitooleela nabo; mutizūbazunīlīja a bashike bing'we ū kūtoolwa na a bitūnja babo, na a bitūnja bing'we yaya ū kūbatoola a bashīke babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bakūbagalūcha a bitūnja bing'we, booye kūnilondeela nene, bandye kūbatūmamīla bamulungu bangī, a heneho ū SEEBA akūmupelanīla wangū no amukenaagūle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī ya kūbīītīla a banhū benabo yīyī: Ī myalīlo yabo īsambaagūlagi gete, hama balī na mawe bakagalamyaga; nago gabelagūlagi. Na ng'hīngī ja Maashela balī najo, nī jene jikambagūlagi, na a mashiikolile gabo gapembagi mu moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basolwa ba ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū bebe ūlī ihanga lyeela ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako; ū SEEBA Mulungu wako wakūsola kūfuma ū mu banhū a bose abo balī mu sī; gīkī ūbize ihanga lya banhū bakwe ba wikomangīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu atang'olekegije ū būtogwa wakwe a bing'we mu nzīla ya kūmusola īkī gīkī ng'walī bingī no kūtinda a banhū a bangī; ītī gīko yaya, nguno a bing'we ng'walī bagehu no kūtinda pye a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo yalī kūlwa nguno īkī ū SEEBA amutogilwe no; na lūūlū washikīlīja kwisagīja ūko walī wabisagīja bakūlūgenji bing'we. H'ī nguno yene akamukomoola na nkono gwa būdūla, ūmufunya ū mu sī ya būsese, ng'wīnga ū mu nkono go ng'wa Falao ū ntemi wa Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū itegelejagi gīkī, ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, hū ng'wene ū Mulungu; ū wei alī Mulungu nsanyiwa, akadimīīlaga ilagane lyakwe kū bose mu būtogwa būshikanu, kūshisha shihūmbī sha shibyalīlwe sha banhū abo bantogilwe na bashidimile ī shilagīlo shakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abo bankolilwe, akabashokejaga īyo ībigelelilwe, gīkī abayagaje gete. Atadīlaga ū kūbamalīla shiilī abo bankolilwe, kūlenganīla nū mumo ībigeleelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īng'wigeleelilwe kwilang'hana no no no, mushimīzīle ū mu kahelele na a malange gakwe, nī shilagīlo īsho nalīng'winha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūshidīlīla ī shilagīlo shenīshi, hama ng'wilang'hana ng'ūdūla kūshimīzīla musho, ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūlīlang'hana ī lilagane lyakwe ū kūlī bebe mu būtogwa, gīt'ūmo wabilahīlīla bakūlūgenji bako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo akūkūtogwa no ūkūfuuha na ningī, gīkī mukwīle kūtinda. Ū būbyīle wa nda yako akūwīlūkīla mbango, pyī na a matwajo gako ga kūfuma mu malaale ī shilīwa shako, mizabibu yako, na a maguta akūgafuuha mbango; nī ndama ja mu madaale gako, na a baana ba ng'holo na a ba mbūli jako. Ī yose yenīyī akūkwītīla ū mu sī īyo wabisagīja bakūlūgenji bako gīkī akūkwinha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūkūbiza na kūtinda pye a banhū ba mu sī, atīho nūūlū munhū ūmò, ngosha nūūlū nkīma ūyo akūbiza ngumba; na gūtīho ntugo gwako nūūlū gūmò ūyo gūtūdūla kwibyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akūkwīngīja pyī ī mbika ja mabūsaatu; atūkūgwisīja na hado yaya a mabūsaatu gabūbi ayo walī ūgamanile mu sī ya Misili, a genayo akūbagwisīja abo bakūkolilwe ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū shikwigeleelilwe kūbamala pye a banhū abo SEEBA Mulungu wako alabatūūle mu nkono gwako. Ūtizūbachīla shigongo nūūlū hado yaya, hama a bamulungu babo ūtizūgima gete kūbatūmamīla nūūlū hado; nguno ū lwenūlo lūkūbiza lūtu lwa kūkūgwasha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu akūkūpyenela mahanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūshikile kwiganika, “A mahanga genaya galī na nguzu no kūtinda a bise. Tūkūdūla kinehe ū kūgapeeja gatwīngīle?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūbogoha nūūlū hado a banhū benabo, ū bebe izūkagwa dūhū ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wako akang'wītīla ū Falao na a bana Misili a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkabona na miso gako īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako akīyīta; ūbona mihayo ya kūluhya kūtaale, na shimanīkījo sha kūkumya na kūdedebaja, ūgūbona ū nkono gwakwe gwa būdūla, ū nkono ūyo akagūgoloola ng'wikanza lya kūkūfunya ū mu sī yenīyo. Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūgīītīla gīko na a mahanga pye ayo ūlīgogoha genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūbatūmīla būkalasa, kūshisha bashile pyī, na a bakūyūng'witūlūganya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya gete ū kūbogoha a benabo, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, ūyo alī hamò nang'ho, alī Mulungu ntaale na wa lyogohya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūgīnja had hado a mahanga genayo gakwīngīle; yaya ū kūgapeeja pye a gose haho na haho ikanza līmò, nguno mashiinū ga mu mapoolu gakwibyala gakwīle gakūkoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūbatūūla mu nkono gwako a banhū benabo, abinhe ng'holò ya kūbbaha kūshisha bashile pye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batemi babo akūbatūūla mu nkono gwako, kūshisha ūlīpyagūle ī lina lyabo lījimangūke gete, lyīnge a ha sīlīlī y'igūlū. Atīho nūūlū ūmò wabo ūyo akūgima kūkwīmīla ū bebe; ūkūbakenaagūla pye gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shiikolile sha ba mulungu babo ūshipemba mu moto. Yaya ū kūjikūmva ī zahabu nūūlū feza ījo jizwalīkījiwe ū kū mashiikolile genayo; yaya nūūlū kūjisola gīkī nang'ho ūbize wipandīkīla. Ūlū wīta gīko ūkwigwasha mu būsese wa kūgatūmamīla, nguno a mashiikolo genayo galī ga malofu ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
